"open":{"rental":"Confirmed line 11 (Gewerbliche Vermietung) is rejected: 'Austria levies no Gewerbesteuer — the Gewerbesteuergesetz 1953 is not in force (RIS)' and 'a Gewerbeberechtigung brings Wirtschaftskammer membership' appear on none of its three pages (oesterreich.gv.at only says the income type depends on the kind of letting; BMF only the V&V 'grundsätzlich'; § 2 GSVG only insures chamber members). Needs a source URL for the GewStG status (RIS) and WKG membership.","tax":"The BMJ Befreiung link cited for the expired Hauptwohnsitz exemption (€500,000 / €2 million terms) now shows 'Seite nicht gefunden', and the consolidated GGG no longer carries §§ 25a-25c, so those figures have no live source; replace the link (e.g. a RIS historical version of § 25a GGG) before closing.","risks":"The HORA 3D table row still states '(since 2023)' unlabelled although this run found no primary source for the year and labels it 'not re-verified' in the prose; and confirmed line 23 (radon) carries 'under Land law implementing OIB-Richtlinie 3', which none of its pages state."}}
